<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Choices, choices,</l><l>We must all make choices.</l><l>Don’t be jealous</l><l>Of what another has,</l><l>Choices, choices,</l><l>We must all make choices.</l><l>Just be satisfied</l><l>With what you have.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
